meta {
  name: f18-4-inventory-followup
  seq: 19
}

docs {
  Follow-up of the front routes (F18.4): the inventory routes carry the iTop fields of F18.3 (description, CPU
  and RAM of each CI; category, status, description and licence of each installation; the categories of each
  product and its category filter), and the ticket list gives the numeric iTop id its filters take. They only
  read, so the folder runs any number of times.
}
